  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Economic Policy Dialogue Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To prepare analytical reports and organise targeted events, which highlight, scrutinise and assess Jordan&apos;s broader economic situation. In-depth understanding of the economic developments will contribute to the dialogue between the European Union and Jordan and will enhance the relevance of the EU programming and programme/project implementation. The reports will also contribute to keeping the EU Delegation to Jordan, officials in Brussels as well as EU Member States Embassies in the country updated on relevant socio-economic developments in the country.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
